  "headline": "Brigjen Tedjo Kusumo Faces Ethics Trial Over Alleged Treason Case",
  "seoTitle": "Brigjen Tedjo Kusumo Treason Investigation",
  "metaDescription": "The Indonesian National Police are conducting an ethics trial for Brigjen Tedjo Kusumo, who is accused of surveillance against government officials.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "The Indonesian National Police (Polri) Divpropam is holding an ethics hearing for Brigjen Tedjo Kusumo regarding his role in a treason investigation.",
    "Bareskrim Polri reports that the former official tracked high-ranking individuals including candidates for Police Chief and palace officials.",
    "Investigators identified external funding sources for the operation and discovered multiple command posts in Jakarta, Bogor, and Tangerang."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Indonesian National Police (Polri) are currently investigating a high-profile case of alleged treason involving Brigjen Tedjo Kusumo, the former intelligence director of Densus 88. According to reports from Bareskrim Polri, the suspect was allegedly involved in systematic surveillance activities targeting government officials, including those in the presidential palace and candidates for the National Police Chief position. Investigations into the operation have uncovered four command posts established across Jakarta, Bogor, and Tangerang. Furthermore, authorities have identified external parties suspected of providing operational funding for these activities. During recent searches, police seized various pieces of evidence, including documents and banners. Following these developments, the police division for internal security (Divpropam) has initiated an ethics hearing to address the conduct of the official in connection with these serious allegations as the criminal inquiry continues.",
